omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bna-8SzCe6cQ7kNvwFY1MRc&_nc_oc=AdrFIbAGcwzyVTQQQ2imaGEt8z7shL3p0TSuW1BmoQza0rPvuprnS2ZtF2mw9Yug644&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPutNpo9relZivc7HanmC9-lWfIJ9XetmEqNaWyfcYnDQ&oe=6AE364B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G-b7n1rWOJMQ7kNvwGenUB0&_nc_oc=Adqzoyuk63lcKQIe-IJskzckqHITYHyZcHLGcH_3TtdEIB52F8Zl7J6JTCNU9d_J9T4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNrvPVX6bVFKG_iLp3G9hloAABhUGrV4YSHWQ6lBhdc8g&oe=6AE36616"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=neae1mTkTFQQ7kNvwGZ7IqD&_nc_oc=Adp8nMRYUOFinkabrt5Or7s6cknCe92B8qF0pnQD6CRkRyufx8i_KUsbIafimMYA5W4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNJMkVMwhyZk_LZA0NTvvGLl-6BLdzZ2vqrjEqpR5zQUQ&oe=6AE342F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://